  "description": "\n  \n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOrigin Lab Game World Scans v2.1.0\n\t\n\nOrigin Lab Game World Scans v2.1.0 is a multi-view RGB-D dataset of frozen game worlds for 3D reconstruction, novel view synthesis, camera-controlled video generation and metric depth and normal estimation: 106.7 hours of free-camera sweeps through 17 licensed games, recorded inside the game engine at 60 FPS, mostly at 1920×1080, with world time stopped and the player hidden, with engine depth, world-space surface normals, camera pose and… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/originlab/game-recordings-free-camera-v2.",
